title: Discard a card
subtitle: Once a month, free of charge.
is-pinned-card: true
view-if: {! return PolishRules.discardAvailable(Q) !}
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
PolishRules.refreshHandMirrors(Q, this.state);
!}

= Discard a card

Once a month you may discard one card from your hand for free. The card goes back to its deck: it has no effect and starts no cooldown.

[? if pl_hand_count = 0 : Your hand is empty, so there is nothing to discard now. ?]

- @slot_1
- @slot_2
- @slot_3
- @keep

@slot_1
title: Discard the first card
subtitle: [+ pl_hand_card_1 +]
view-if: {! return PolishRules.handCardId(this.state, 0) !== null !}
go-to: root
on-arrival: {!
PolishRules.discardFromHand(Q, this.state, 0);
!}

@slot_2
title: Discard the second card
subtitle: [+ pl_hand_card_2 +]
view-if: {! return PolishRules.handCardId(this.state, 1) !== null !}
go-to: root
on-arrival: {!
PolishRules.discardFromHand(Q, this.state, 1);
!}

@slot_3
title: Discard the third card
subtitle: [+ pl_hand_card_3 +]
view-if: {! return PolishRules.handCardId(this.state, 2) !== null !}
go-to: root
on-arrival: {!
PolishRules.discardFromHand(Q, this.state, 2);
!}

@keep
title: Back to the hand
go-to: root
